<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 15-NOV.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 15-NOV.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Ernie, with 40 mph winds, is in the South China Sea, near Vietnam. Ernie is expected to remain fairly weak as it tracks across far southern Vietnam and the Gulf of Thailand this weekend. Shipping may be affected. This system may also caused local flooding as in far southern Vietnam. It does not appear to be a major problem for either area.</p>
</text>
